# The character models are intentionally NOT tracked with Git LFS.
#
# Vercel does not resolve Git LFS objects when it clones a repository for a
# deployment. Any LFS-tracked .glb file is therefore deployed as its ~130 byte
# pointer text instead of the real binary, the GLTF loader fails to parse it,
# and the 3D character never renders.
#
# The models are well under GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit, so they are stored
# as regular blobs.